  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Capacity Health \u2014 headline",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": [],
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Credential Accounts (tracked)",
      "description": "Distinct non-E2E credential accounts the probe is currently reporting on. count(max by (account)(...)) dedups the per-pod gauge republish so it is a true account count, not a series count. E2E/probe accounts are excluded (account!~\"(?i:e2e-.*|probe-acct-.*)\", ka-0000005167).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "no gardenio_account_utilization_5h data returned. Empty is NOT \u201czero accounts\u201d \u2014 but this panel cannot tell an unreported probe from a genuinely empty account set. Resolve with the independent target \u201c#12 Probe-loop dead-man \u2014 seconds since last tick\u201d on Gardenio \u2014 Control-plane Liveness: if that is ticking, the probe is running and the absence is real.",
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "count(max by (account) (gardenio_account_utilization_5h{account!~\"(?i:e2e-.*|probe-acct-.*)\"}))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Credential Accounts (tracked)"
        }
      ],
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Accounts Throttled Now",
      "description": "Accounts currently rate-limited (gardenio_account_throttled==1, set when the probe's throttle_status==\"rejected\"). 0 is healthy; any non-zero value means at least one account is being 429'd by the provider right now. count() of a max-by-account filtered to >0, so per-pod churn cannot double-count. Empty-branch liveness: the `or vector(0)` fallback is gated on `count(gardenio_account_utilization_5h) > 0` \u2014 a sibling gauge the same probe pass Set()s alongside this one \u2014 so a green 0 appears only when the probe genuinely reported and found nothing; if the probe stops, the panel stays empty and says so.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "no value. Empty is AMBIGUOUS and this panel cannot resolve it: the expr counts only accounts over the threshold, so \u201cno account is throttled\u201d and \u201cthe probe published no gardenio_account_throttled at all\u201d both yield an empty inner vector \u2014 as does the datasource not answering. Resolve with the independent target \u201c#12 Probe-loop dead-man \u2014 seconds since last tick\u201d on Gardenio \u2014 Control-plane Liveness: probe ticking \u21d2 genuinely zero throttled.",
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "count(max by (account) (gardenio_account_throttled{account!~\"(?i:e2e-.*|probe-acct-.*)\"}) > 0) or (vector(0) and (count(gardenio_account_utilization_5h{account!~\"(?i:e2e-.*|probe-acct-.*)\"}) > 0))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Accounts Throttled Now"
        }
      ],
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Accounts Warming (soft-failover)",
      "description": "Accounts in soft-failover warming state (gardenio_account_warming==1, set when the probe's soft_failover_state==\"warming\"). Warming means the broker has shifted load off this account and is easing it back in \u2014 expected transiently after a throttle, a concern if persistent. Empty-branch liveness: the `or vector(0)` fallback is gated on `count(gardenio_account_utilization_5h) > 0` \u2014 a sibling gauge the same probe pass Set()s alongside this one \u2014 so a green 0 appears only when the probe genuinely reported and found nothing; if the probe stops, the panel stays empty and says so.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "no value. Empty is AMBIGUOUS and this panel cannot resolve it: the expr counts only accounts in warming, so \u201cno account is warming\u201d and \u201cthe probe published no gardenio_account_warming at all\u201d both yield an empty inner vector \u2014 as does the datasource not answering. Resolve with the independent target \u201c#12 Probe-loop dead-man \u2014 seconds since last tick\u201d on Gardenio \u2014 Control-plane Liveness: probe ticking \u21d2 genuinely zero warming.",
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "count(max by (account) (gardenio_account_warming{account!~\"(?i:e2e-.*|probe-acct-.*)\"}) > 0) or (vector(0) and (count(gardenio_account_utilization_5h{account!~\"(?i:e2e-.*|probe-acct-.*)\"}) > 0))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Accounts Warming (soft-failover)"
        }
      ],
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Accounts Near 5h Ceiling (\u226580%)",
      "description": "Accounts whose 5-hour rolling-window utilization is at or above 0.8 \u2014 the early-warning band before a hard throttle. utilization_5h is the ratio (0.0-1.0) the Anthropic rate-limit probe reports for the 5h window. When this is non-zero, watch the 'Throttle & Warming timeline' below for a transition. Empty-branch liveness: the `or vector(0)` fallback is gated on `count(gardenio_account_throttled) > 0` \u2014 a sibling gauge the same probe pass Set()s alongside this one \u2014 so a green 0 appears only when the probe genuinely reported and found nothing; if the probe stops, the panel stays empty and says so.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "no value. Empty is AMBIGUOUS and this panel cannot resolve it: the expr counts only accounts at \u226580% of the 5h window, so \u201cnobody is near the ceiling\u201d and \u201cthe probe published no gardenio_account_utilization_5h at all\u201d both yield an empty inner vector \u2014 as does the datasource not answering. Resolve with the independent target \u201c#12 Probe-loop dead-man \u2014 seconds since last tick\u201d on Gardenio \u2014 Control-plane Liveness.",
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "count(max by (account) (gardenio_account_utilization_5h{account!~\"(?i:e2e-.*|probe-acct-.*)\"}) >= 0.8) or (vector(0) and (count(gardenio_account_throttled{account!~\"(?i:e2e-.*|probe-acct-.*)\"}) > 0))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Accounts Near 5h Ceiling (\u226580%)"
        }
      ],
      "id": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
