    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API request rate per account (req/s)",
      "description": "Per-second API request rate per account, derived as rate() of the cumulative gardenio_account_requests_current gauge over $__rate_interval (the gauge only climbs, so rate() recovers throughput; the tiny dips at counter resets read as 0, never negative). Shows which accounts are carrying live load right now.",
